und robins; it decides the continental places after the champions.","The bottom 3 of the promedio go down: points per match over 2 seasons, a club promoted since averaging over its own seasons.","Uruguay 4 in the Libertadores is the Copa AUF Uruguay champion, a cup Sofascore does not carry; the simulation gives that place to the next club in the Tabla Anual, and the Sudamericana places follow the Anual (the 2025 practice). No AUF reglamento for 2026 was found."]},"adjustments":[{"stage":"clausura","team":"Club Atlético Peñarol","points":-1}],"unlisted_results":[{"stage":"apertura","home":"Albion FC","away":"Juventud de Las Piedras","score":[1,0]},{"stage":"apertura","home":"Central Español","away":"Danubio","score":[0,0]},{"stage":"apertura","home":"Deportivo Maldonado","away":"Nacional","score":[1,0]},{"stage":"intermedio","home":"Club Atlético Peñarol","away":"Liverpool UY","score":[0,3]},{"stage":"clausura","home":"Progreso","away":"CA Cerro","score":[0,1]},{"stage":"clausura","home":"Cerro Largo","away":"Central Español","score":[0,0]}],"updated_at":"2026-11-04T01:52:55Z"}